":" ever","strong":"H5769"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":22628,"title":"Micah 4:8","segments":["¶And thou, O tower of the flock, the strong hold of the daughter of Zion, unto thee shall it come, even the first dominion; the kingdom shall come to the daughter of Jerusalem."],"ref":"Micah 4:8","verse":8,"words":[{"text":"¶And thou, O tower","strong":"H4026"},{"text":" of the flock","strong":"H5739"},{"text":"","strong":"H4029"},{"text":", the strong hold","strong":"H6076"},{"text":" of the daughter","strong":"H1323"},{"text":" of Zion","strong":"H6726"},{"text":", unto thee shall it come","strong":"H857"},{"text":", even the first","strong":"H7223"},{"text":" dominion","strong":"H4475"},{"text":"; the kingdom","strong":"H4467"},{"text":" shall come","strong":"H935"},{"text":" to the daughter","strong":"H1323"},{"text":" of Jerusalem","strong":"H3389"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":22629,"title":"Micah 4:9","segments":["Now why dost thou cry out aloud? [is there] no king in thee? is thy counsellor perished? for pangs have taken thee as a woman in travail."],"ref":"Micah 4:9","verse":9,"words":[{"text":"Now why dost thou cry","strong":"H7321"},{"text":" out aloud","strong":"H7452"},{"text":"? [is there] no king","strong":"H4428"},{"text":" in thee? is thy counsellor","strong":"H3289"},{"text":" perished","strong":"H6"},{"text":"? for pangs","strong":"H2427"},{"text":" have taken","strong":"H2388"},{"text":" thee as a woman in travail","strong":"H3205"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":22630,"title":"Micah 4:10","segments":["Be in pain, and labour to bring forth, O daughter of Zion, like a woman in travail: for now shalt thou go forth out of the city, and thou shalt dwell in the field, and thou shalt go [even] to Babylon; there shalt thou be delivered; there the LORD shall redeem thee from the hand of thine enemies."],"ref":"Micah 4:10","verse":10,"words":[{"text":"Be in pain","strong":"H2342"},{"text":", and labour to bring forth","strong":"H1518"},{"text":", O daughter","strong":"H1323"},{"text":"